      "description": "Root cause. The identifier-scan loop dereferences `*in` before checking `in != end` and does not treat the appended NUL as a terminator, so a separator-free property token that reaches EOF advances `in` to `end` and makes the next condition evaluation read one byte past the vector's logical end."
